5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Let's begin. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we observe each other's behavior carefully.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It's too early to make accusations.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Indeed. We should focus on finding any contradictions in our statements as the days progress.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minato,,"I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help everyone.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,A quiet start is best. I will simply listen for now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,Does anyone have a specific strategy they'd like to propose for the voting process?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,Perhaps we should avoid voting for the same person unless there is strong evidence.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,That's logical. We shouldn't waste a vote on a whim.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, you seem very confident. It's impressive.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
