16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"Confidence isn't necessarily a sign of guilt, though.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,I just want us to be efficient. I'm sure we can find the werewolf if we stay calm.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
