31,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I have information. Mizuki is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"That was fast. Toshio, are you the Seer?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,What? That's a blatant lie. I am a villager. Toshio is trying to frame me.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Minato,,Eh? Already? I can't believe it...,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,A bold claim right at the start. This changes the atmosphere.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I am the Seer. My divination was clear. Mizuki is the enemy.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mizuki, do you have any rebuttal other than denying it?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,Other than the truth? Toshio is likely the werewolf or the possessed trying to eliminate me early.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Minato,,But Toshio seems so sure... I don't know who to believe.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If Toshio is the Seer, the game ends today. If he is lying, he is the threat.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I have no reason to lie. Executing Mizuki now is the safest path for the village.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"It's a high-risk move, but if Toshio is the Seer, it's the only move.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,Don't be fooled by his calm demeanor. He's manipulating you all.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I want to believe Toshio-san, but Mizuki-san is usually so reliable...","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,The logic of the Seer is straightforward. I lean toward Toshio.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Let's vote.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm convinced.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,You'll regret this!,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll trust Toshio-san.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
